        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A 10,000 watt generator runs a house the way a careful family lives through an outage: essentials always on, one heavy appliance at a time, and the big resistive loads on a schedule. On a well house with gas heat it feels almost normal. With central air it works only if the compressor has a soft starter and the connection is 50 amps. In an all-electric house it keeps the essentials and one comfort going, not the whole place.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Do the arithmetic once with your own appliance labels, write the shedding order on the panel door, and the generator will do what you planned. If the plan needs two big loads at once, size up rather than hoping. For the machines themselves, start with our <a href="/best-portable-generator/">best portable generators</a> roundup.
